   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"{x^2}-5x + 5 = 0\">{x^2}-5x + 5 = 0</span> can be graphed as:\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/d14dee79c0717098.jpg\" alt=\"A parabola is plotted on an x y coordinate plane. The x and y axes range from negative 10 to 10, in increments of 1. The parabola opens up and it passes through the following points, (1, 0), (3, negative 4), and (5, 0).\">",
