     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>False. For example, substitute <span data-math=\"(1, 0)\"></span> into the equation.</p>\n<p>Substitute 1 in for <span data-math=\"x.\"></span> You expect the result to be 0, but it is 1.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{(1)^2} - 5(1) + 5 = 1 - 5 + 5 = 1\"></span></p>"
